<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\quiet-residential-area1.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Shiyo 800, April 1―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\大学.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
One week to the thirteenth-year memorial.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Spring break had ended yesterday, and school today was morning only.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Apparently a girl named <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> was coming to Tokyo today.<PG>
"<STYLE ID="2">Chigaya</STYLE>, this year's freshmen are a lot of fun!
{PAUSE ""}
　There's a welcome party tonight―you're coming, right!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
An invitation from Hana-chan, my best friend in Tokyo.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Normally I'd have said yes on the spot, but...<PG>
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... Sorry, Hana-chan! I've got relatives coming today..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Oh, I see... Well, the freshmen aren't going anywhere, so I'll ask you again next time!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Lately I'd been turning down a lot of party invitations.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And more and more often, Hana-chan looked a little awkward about asking me.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\茅萱の部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―I went home, washed my face, did my makeup, and put on that going-out outfit again.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The place <STYLE ID="3">Auntie</STYLE> had named was that ryotei in Ginza.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Apparently all it took to hook this <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> girl was to dangle some food in front of her, but was a girl like that really going to be all right?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\料亭外観.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The place had the same air of luxury as ever.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was only my second time, and just opening the door made me nervous.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was running a little past the time we'd agreed on. Were the two of them here already?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\引き戸.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\料亭玄関.gal" "NORMAL" "4" "2000" "960" "1" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Welcome, <STYLE ID="2">Niimura-sama</STYLE>."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The same attendant as the other day came out to greet me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I regretted, just a little, wearing the same clothes.<PG>
"Allow me to show you the way. Your <STYLE ID="3">companions</STYLE> are waiting for you."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So they were already here after all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We're asking <STYLE ID="1">Goto-san</STYLE> to help with a case this serious.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She may be younger than me, but I have to treat her with every courtesy.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\3回ノック.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
"Excuse me. Your <STYLE ID="2">companion</STYLE> has arrived."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\料亭部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬腰に手バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "4" "2000" "960" "1" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Munch munch... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Mm-hm! This flounder sashimi is really delicious!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Ohohohoho, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! That's sea bream sashimi!"</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "ごろごろゲームする日_2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hm! And this fugu shabu-shabu here is thick and has a good bite to it. Most delectable!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! This is octopus shabu-shabu!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I opened the door, the two of them had already started feasting.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\料亭料理.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Auntie</STYLE> only seemed to be drinking tea, but in front of the girl who had to be <STYLE ID="1">Goto-san</STYLE>, expensive dishes were crammed in with no room to spare.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What is this? Not a shred of tension...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Oh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, you're here!? Come on, come on, sit down!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh! So this is </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Niimura-senpai's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> cousin, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chigaya-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Pleased to meet you! Motoki-cho's genius girl Erina Goto has descended upon Tokyo!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Th-<STYLE ID="1">this girl</STYLE> is really a genius girl...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Feasting on the food without a care, and a greeting as breezy as could be...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It threw me completely off...<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... I'm Chigaya Niimura. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Thank you so much for coming all this way."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just as planned, I greeted her with the utmost courtesy.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ooh! So </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="たお">graceful</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="しと">ladylike</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is a whole other story."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Really! I wish </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> would learn to carry herself a little more like a lady!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ahahaha! But I like </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> just the way she is!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Oh! And this is beef nigiri!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Ohohoho, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! That's pickled red turnip!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Somehow... didn't my greeting just get skipped right over?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not ignored, exactly, but it feels like I'm being skipped over.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, how long are you going to stand there? Sit, sit!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... Okay..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Still thrown off, I sat down next to <STYLE ID="3">Auntie</STYLE>.<PG>
Even so, <STYLE ID="1">this girl</STYLE> really eats a lot.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe she even eats more than I do.<PG>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"Aren't you two going to eat anything?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　You're here, so please eat. Don't be shy!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"That's right! What'll you have, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What is with <STYLE ID="1">this girl</STYLE>! <STYLE ID="3">Auntie</STYLE> is the one paying, isn't she!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We may be relying on her, but the nerve of her...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Auntie</STYLE>, not looking the least bit bothered by it, handed me the menu.<PG>
Ugh... as expected, every set was expensive...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
How much is just the food on the table already costing?<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... I'll have this, the seasonal set..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh? Oh? That's the cheapest set, isn't it?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Could it be, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chigaya-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, that you're a light eater?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What a nervy girl...! Even I was starting to get a little irritated...<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I can eat plenty too, if I put my mind to it...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　I've beaten most of the eating-challenge menus I've tried!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ooh!? A rival for this genius girl has appeared, I see!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Oh my, that sounds fun!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Then how about a contest to see who can eat more of the sushi here!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, no, wait, wait―what is this <STYLE ID="3">old bat</STYLE> saying...!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Does she know it would run to hundreds of thousands of yen if I really ate in a place like this...!?<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\テーブル叩く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="7">"That's enough!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The mood was all wrong for what we'd come to discuss, and before I knew it, my fist had come down on the table.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"A-</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! Save that for later and let's start talking!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you know perfectly well what you came here for today, don't you!?"</STYLE><PG>
Calling her <STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE> and lecturing her had slipped out without my meaning to, but it was rare for me to get this angry.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Somehow, it felt like I was being made fun of.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then <STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE> flashed a big grin.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "五島.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Ehehe! At last, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chigaya-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you're talking normally with me!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　You seemed so nervous that I got a little worried."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Huh? What does that mean...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Did she do it on purpose, to ease my nerves?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, no―that's just <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="そうせきちんりゅう">a sore loser's sophistry</STYLE>!<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! I'll have this fugu and wagyu special set!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I pointed at the pricey 39,800-yen (before tax and service charge, drinks not included) set.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Okay, okaaay! Then I'll have the same!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
And <STYLE ID="3">Auntie</STYLE> picked up the room's phone.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chigaya-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! What does </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> call you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you mean? </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> calls me Chiga-nee."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Then can I call you </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> too?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE> sipped the bamboo-shoot soup and flashed a big grin again.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This girl</STYLE> is even more childish than she looks...<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... Chiga-nee is fine."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Then, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! I look forward to working with you!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
And <STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE> held out a hand with a grain of rice stuck to it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I wasn't quite convinced, but I held out my hand too and took <STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan's</STYLE> hand.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Such a small hand...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She was supposed to be smart, but there weren't any study calluses on it.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... Likewise."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A beat late, I shook on it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But <STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE> kept looking me in the eye and wouldn't let go of my hand.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Still smiling, she was staring steadily into my eyes.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
No... 
{PAUSE ""}
That's not it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This girl</STYLE> isn't smiling.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Only her mouth was smiling; behind her eyes was a glare sharp enough to curse someone dead.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"What's wrong? Do I look that scary?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... No, it's nothing..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At last <STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE> let go of my hand.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It wasn't that <STYLE ID="1">this girl</STYLE> had been fooling around from the start.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The whole time, she'd kept up a smile while observing my every move.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Without meaning to, I looked down.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, what do you want to do?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Ghost.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan's</STYLE> tone of voice dropped drastically.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Before I knew it, the big grin had vanished as well.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"There's time before your food arrives. Should we talk until then?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　It probably won't take very long."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Won't take long? That couldn't be.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not even if she'd already heard the story from <STYLE ID="3">Auntie</STYLE> beforehand.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... Let's wait until after we've eaten. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">If we talk while we eat, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, your food will get cold."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"You're right. Let's do that."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With that, <STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE> tossed a few slices of octopus into the shabu-shabu pot.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"With octopus shabu-shabu, rather than pulling it out of the water right away, I like it </STYLE><STYLE ID="9" RUBY="ゆ">boiled</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> a little longer."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Octopuses come in all sorts of colors while they're alive, but do you know why they turn red when you </STYLE><STYLE ID="9" RUBY="ゆ">boil</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> them?"</STYLE><PG>
