<BR>
Can <STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE> already see it...?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\タコ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"An octopus's body is almost all muscle. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But they are not all brawn and no brain. They are said to be the most intelligent of all invertebrates. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">They recognize objects, and they even show learned behavior like taking food out of a container with a lid. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But an octopus only lives about 2 years. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If octopuses lived as long as humans do, they might have become humanity's natural enemy."</STYLE><PG>
I have no idea what <STYLE ID="1">this girl</STYLE> is getting at.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is she saying talk about octopuses can prevent a curse-killing?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, rather than trying to feel her out, I'd better just ask her straight.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
