{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, does what you just said lead anywhere toward solving the curse-killings?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No, I was just showing off what I know a little. </STYLE>
