<STYLE ID="1">"But I suppose my head keeps drifting toward the curse-killings without my realizing it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And <STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE> slowly put the last of the octopus into the pot.<PG>
