{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\タコ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"This octopus can only live 2 years, so it gets eaten by humans. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But if it lived many more years, it might have learned ways to kill humans and ended up ruling even the land. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">They say an octopus can stay active on land for a good 30 minutes. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">It is fascinating to think how much a 20-year-old octopus and a 20-year-old human would differ in physical ability and intelligence."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then she brought the last of the octopus to her mouth and finally set down her chopsticks.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
