{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hmm, this isn't really the mood for enjoying a meal anymore. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Well then, shall we begin the operation?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It looked like she meant to get into the curse-killings in earnest now.
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "258" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"What I think is this: we must not consider either the method or the culprit within the bounds of common sense. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">―setting aside whether you really killed five people, your murderous intent had already sprouted by the time you were 11. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Even if the chance is not zero, no one would normally imagine an 11-year-old child killing an adult. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">―the theory that you were the culprit was a little outside common sense, so you were never suspected."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"In this case, it would not be strange to think that a bear cub whose parent was killed by the people of Arata had come to take </STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="ふくしゅう">revenge</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Bears are said to be tenacious and cautious, and to have intelligence on a par with primates. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Nor is there any contradiction in a bear that has learned how frightening humans are attacking the settlement's people to protect its own peace."</STYLE><PG>
A bear as the curse-killer...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Besides, that doesn't explain why it was someone else and not me who killed the five, or why they were killed with a blunt instrument.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's contradictory enough as it is...<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I know what </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> are getting at. That if a bear were the culprit, there would be too many contradictions. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But right now, every theory produces a contradiction. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Impossible for a human, impossible for an animal, and to begin with, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> were not the culprit. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Since it is a case, there has to be a correct answer. And yet contradictions arise. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Do you understand what that means?"</STYLE><PG>
A case where contradictions always arise...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even though there must be a correct answer...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's a contradictory idea in itself...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A correct answer that exists even while contradicting itself―something like that...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
Contradiction... 
{PAUSE ""}
and the answer...?<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"A contradiction is... the answer?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Exactly. Every deduction and every investigation runs straight into a contradiction."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... Then does that mean there's absolutely no way to ever reach the truth...?"</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\z50逆.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you know what happened in Megasawa City in the past, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... I know..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"If </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> had committed the crimes, the drug called Droga might have turned them into an unsolved case. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">A case full of contradictions ends up buried in the dark."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"That's right. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and the others―I'd even planned a faked alibi using them, and with movements no human could make, I think it would at least have become a baffling case."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... But in that case, there was still a truth with no contradictions, wasn't there?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's right. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">To us right now, the curse-killings look riddled with contradictions. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">It is only when something common sense cannot conceive of, like Droga, enters the picture that the contradictions are cleared away. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">That is what the octopus and bear examples I gave earlier were about. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If the culprit is 'human,' there's a contradiction. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Not that the curse-killer is an octopus or a bear."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... So you mean something impossible by common sense, like Droga, has gotten into the curse-killings too, and it's getting in the way of uncovering the truth?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Precisely. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">And it is happening inside the Arata settlement. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">What this means is―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
