<STYLE ID="2">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> have, like </STYLE><STYLE ID="14">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Sakura Niimura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, the ability to foresee danger. </STYLE>
