<STYLE ID="1">What </STYLE><STYLE ID="14">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> describes as </STYLE><STYLE ID="14">'</STYLE><STYLE ID="16">Eiichiro Niimura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="14">'s voice'</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is exactly that. </STYLE>
