{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\料亭部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"So how can the curse-killings be prevented? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">For that, we have to reach this master of contradictions."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... The master of contradictions..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Unfortunately, though, this is as far as we can go with what we know now. Let's think about it again once we have more detailed information."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... What about </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Mom's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> curse, or that kind of paranormal angle―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"99% impossible."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... How can you be so sure?"</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\クリスタルコア.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"If it were, someone like me showing up wouldn't be of any use. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Even if there is a 1% chance it is that angle, the standard approach is to test every practical possibility we can think of, and only switch over to that one if they all fail."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"To begin with, I hear the people of Arata believe the curse-killings are </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Sakura Niimura-san's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> curse, but has that led to solving anything?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... Nothing."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Right? </STYLE><STYLE ID="19" RUBY="・・・">Escaping</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> into the paranormal is no different from giving up.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　That being so, unless we rule out that angle, we will make no progress at all. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">There must be something. Something that looks paranormal but, like Droga, is a scientific element no one could have imagined with the common sense we had until now."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... So something our common sense said was impossible is tied up in the curse-killings. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">It isn't anything spiritual. There are bound to be scientific grounds for it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">And the mastermind behind it is giving us our precognition. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But the moment you say precognition, it doesn't sound scientific to me..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Why is that?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... Why, you ask... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Isn't precognition paranormal?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I define the paranormal as things that cannot be explained by the common sense we have had so far or by human senses. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\コウモリ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Bats and dolphins communicate with ultrasound, but humans can neither see it nor hear it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Is that paranormal?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... That's been proven scientifically, so it isn't paranormal."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"But in an age with no concept of ultrasound, communication by ultrasound would have been telepathy―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">in other words, a paranormal phenomenon. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and the others―if your precognition is likewise a sense of receiving some kind of signal, it can't really be called paranormal either, can it?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... That's true..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I understand the urge to call mysterious things paranormal. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But that would mean humanity's defeat. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">As long as we think that way, the curse-killings will never be solved. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">We already have hints like Droga and precognition right in front of us as pieces of the solution, so there is no need to be pessimistic anymore."</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\ノック.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\料亭部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Just then, there was a knock at the door.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seemed the meals for me and <STYLE ID="3">Auntie</STYLE> had arrived.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Let's continue after we've eaten. Food doesn't taste good if you eat it while talking about this kind of thing!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you really switch gears fast."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"It's sad when a meal this nice doesn't taste good. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Hey, hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, what's your college life usually like?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh? Mm... Um, at college―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> told me you're a seriously mean drunk?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!? What did you tell </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬腰に手バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Oh, ohohohoho! I just thought I should fill her in on what </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> are like as well!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\誰もいない校舎で.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\料亭料理.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
After that, we were able to enjoy our meal, chatting and laughing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Honestly, I had underestimated <STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Somewhere in my heart, I'd thought there couldn't be anyone who could solve a case this baffling.<PG>
But when I actually talked to her, what happened? I got all these hints.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Thinking with common sense and thinking in terms of the paranormal had both been nonsense.<PG>
Something outside common sense is happening, so thinking about it with common sense can't possibly solve it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To solve it, we have to start from the elements that are outside common sense.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And behind them, 'the master of contradictions.'<PG>
We already have hold of several pieces of information that are outside common sense.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As long as we don't pick the wrong way in, we should be able to head toward the truth.<PG>
I had a feeling the day I'd learn its true identity was not far off either.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<PG>
{}
